invalid type: string "# Chapter 1 ASK/LOOK/FEEL algorithm: Blisters and pustules\n\nColor legend: green = treat_locally, yellow = refer, red = urgent_referral (warning icon).\n\n- ASK: Pain\n  - Acute\n    - LOOK: Multiple blisters with diffuse redness; mucosa (eyes, mouth, or genitals) may be involved\n      - FEEL: Warm to touch, tender\n        - OTHER: History of intake of new medication(s)\nÿ